<title>USA: Pickens Cty SD, S.C., $1.2 mln won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Pickens Cty SD, S.C., $1.2 mln won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corporation said it won $1.230 million of Pickens County SD, S.C., gneeral obligation refunding bonds, Series 1996 C, with a net interest cost of 4.73 percent.</p>
</text>
